# ── #1012, 2026-08-26: the rows above were folded in by `apply`, which
# (unlike `absorb`) never rewrote the manifest — so they sat here as LIVE
# rows naming originals that were removed at the merge. Marked as the
# history they always were. Absorption is one-way: the umbrella owns
# these bodies, and any fix made to the umbrella since exists only there.
# Restoring an original to regenerate is refused by name —
# `scripts/consolidate_tests.sh audit <area>`.
